{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10134140","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10134140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1013414001:3":{"text":"咻——听我一句劝，打道回府吧。你应该很清楚，我的鞭子只是前奏，弩箭才是正餐。","source_cn":"咻——听我一句劝，打道回府吧。你应该很清楚，我的鞭子只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91759977A5DB28D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013414002:1":{"text":"你想阻止我前进？","source_cn":"你想阻止我前进？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x412D8C925B9BDA56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013414003:1":{"text":"不是阻止你前进——是请求你停下。日神殿对你很危险，这只是个调查任务，傻瓜才会为这种事搭上性命。","source_cn":"不是阻止你前进——是请求你停下。日神殿对你很危险，这只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F4BD5B24719903E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013414004:1":{"text":"我又不是没见过你虚弱濒死，躺在病床上的样子……","source_cn":"我又不是没见过你虚弱濒死，躺在病床上的样子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6AEFA62A2AA09BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013414005:1":{"text":"我已经比当初强大很多了。","source_cn":"我已经比当初强大很多了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x165C6BA39312AEA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013414006:1":{"text":"……我知道。但我还是无法放心——","source_cn":"……我知道。但我还是无法放心——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56F39DC6FD15F84D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013414007:1":{"text":"别搞错了。你为什么觉得我说这种话是为了让你放心？","source_cn":"别搞错了。你为什么觉得我说这种话是为了让你放心？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8702F0CE940AA9E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013414008:0":{"text":"我是在告诉你，你绝无胜算。当年之事不会再重演。请别说我没给过你机会，这一路上都是你处处纠缠……","source_cn":"我是在告诉你，你绝无胜算。当年之事不会再重演。请别说我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x687F6EAE0C05977A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1013414009:1":{"text":"阿塔兰忒，你甚至都不让我放过你。","source_cn":"阿塔兰忒，你甚至都不让我放过你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE046DF801AB3AF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1013414010:1":{"text":"你更该放过自己！当年的事，到底谁在处处纠缠？是谁日复一日，用可笑的苦修教条惩罚自己？","source_cn":"你更该放过自己！当年的事，到底谁在处处纠缠？是谁日复一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB724E1F6F0E8B32A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1013414011:1":{"text":"这是我应得的——我曾辜负艾雅，将圣堂骑士的守则抛诸脑后。现在，是我弥补过错的时候了……","source_cn":"这是我应得的——我曾辜负艾雅，将圣堂骑士的守则抛诸脑后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x118E1CACF290D944","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿塔兰忒":{"text":"阿塔兰忒","source":"阿塔兰忒","status":"source"},"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"特弥希娅","source":"特弥希娅","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":2}}